gnome-shell-extension-workspace-bar (1.0.5) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Crossfade active and inactive workspace labels using GPU opacity on
    stacked labels instead of per-frame inline CSS updates.
  * Delegate animateSwitch to GNOME Shell and retune its transition.
  * Drop redundant restacked sync triggers, bind key-focus only while
    editing, share wm.preferences settings, and build the menu lazily.

